    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns8AAAABDgUmLg",
      "title": "pepeCoin ink deployment",
      "author": "3456smille",
      "number": 1363,
      "body": "Adds pepeCoin to the Superchain token list with its Ink deployment.\n\n- L1 (Ethereum): `0xA9E8aCf069C58aEc8825542845Fd754e41a9489A`\n- L2 (Ink, chainId 57073): `0xcA7f8A00C17A4234B2a61f58Af246f4b104B6FC3`\n\nThe Ink token is a standard `OptimismMintableERC20` deployed through the `OptimismMintableERC20Factory` predeploy (`0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000012`). It uses the standard L2 bridge (`0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000010`), and its `l1Token` points to the Ethereum address above. `name` / `symbol` / `decimals` match the L1 token on-chain (pepeCoin / pepecoin / 18).\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-14T19:47:56Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 16,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns8AAAABDfC2ew",
      "title": "Add ANANSI (Base)",
      "author": "kburrus64-max",
      "number": 1362,
      "body": "Adds ANANSI, the token of [Anansi Data](https://anansidata.xyz), natively deployed on Base.\n\n- **Address:** `0x4e50a097b37Fb3949733Ce9f7356500b9cc9A702`\n- **Chain:** Base (8453) only — natively deployed, so `nobridge: true`\n- **Verified source:** https://basescan.org/address/0x4e50a097b37Fb3949733Ce9f7356500b9cc9A702#code\n- `name`, `symbol` and `decimals` in `data.json` were read from the live contract and match exactly (`Anansi` / `ANANSI` / `18`).\n- Logo is SVG at 256x256.\n- Standard ERC-20: no fee on transfer, no rebasing, no mint function, no owner.\n\n`pnpm validate --datadir ./data --tokens ANANSI` passes locally with exit code 0.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01HZ4nVSXeTrNt3U9kfSwaec",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-14T17:03:56Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 14,
